### Lista de Carros
GET http://localhost:5074/api/carros


### Buscar Carro pelo Id
GET http://localhost:5074/api/carros/1


### Cadastrar Carro
POST http://localhost:5074/api/carros
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Hyundai HB20s",
    "modeloId": 1
}


### Atualiza os dados do Carro
PUT http://localhost:5074/api/carros/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Honda City",
    "modeloId": 1
}


### Remove o Carro pelo Id
DELETE http://localhost:5074/api/carros/1
